next_sentence:
A global system based on the **rule of law, not the rule of force**; 
on the **power of law, not the law of power**; 
on the **strength of reason, not the reasoning of strength**.

context_pm1:
And, last but not least, a turning point that puts to the test the entire system of international relations—its foundations, principles, and rules as codified in the Charter of the United Nations, and the mechanisms, institutions, and structures we have established to serve our collective aspirations and goals. From this perspective, approaching the United Nations' eighth decade must be a chance to reaffirm our commitment to the system that unites us. A global system based on the **rule of law, not the rule of force**; 
on the **power of law, not the law of power**; 
on the **strength of reason, not the reasoning of strength**.

